Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你很愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a nice time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我很悲惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was miserable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会带女孩去赛百味约会？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, who takes their first date to Subway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没他们家的三明治长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like you have a footlong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得看起来像是感染吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this look infected to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有人喝了我的康普茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone drank my kombucha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个鬼鬼祟祟的小婊砸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sneaky little beyatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,姐妹之间没有秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sisters don't keep secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说真的 那人真的谁也不是 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seriously, it was nobody. - Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望"谁也不是"做了保护措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope "nobody" used a condom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们可不想谁看起来像个荡妇 - 丹妮尔 谢谢关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't want "somebody" looking like a whore. - Thanks, Danielle, super helpful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谁叫我们是姐妹呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are sisters for? Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别忘了午饭时有宿舍例会 - 死都忘不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And don't forget, house meeting at lunch. - Living for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你可算回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She finally rolls in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨晚是不是特丢人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I totally embarrass myself last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,才没有呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,除了在桌子上跳舞 和人打了两架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you consider dancing on a table, starting two fights,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把椒盐脆饼块吐得到处都是之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and barfing pretzel chunks all over the bar embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快告诉我这都不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me you're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 你还把舌头伸到尼克·西姆斯的嗓子眼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and you also rammed your tongue down Nick Sims' throat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当着丹妮尔的面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right in front of Danielle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她今天早上还关心我来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she was so nice to me this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 她和你一样昨晚喝大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think she was as drunk as you last night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把这当成集体失忆症吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so consider it collective amnesia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank God for that.{\r}
