Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么发现的？- 你驾照上有出生日期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you find out? - Driver's license.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能说照片还行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the best picture, I might add.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我猜你把我来电铃声也改了 - 谁改的 我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I assume you changed my ringer, too. - Who, me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你许了什么愿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you wish for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想要个新室友 - 傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A new roommate. - Wench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是我亲手做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... I made that from scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 太多碳水化合物了 拜拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Too many carbs. Toodles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,题目中的机能反应表现了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locomotive response in the subject shows an acceleration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,量子平面的加速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}across the quantum plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它导致了部分正价的β碳原子和部分负价的氢碱基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This creates great orbital overlap between the partially positive beta carbon...{\r}
