Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉给你添麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry again about the... the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a douchebag.{\r}
