Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西堵住了 我们刚结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, stupid thing got jammed. Oh, just wrapping up here.{\r}
