Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.30,1:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你昏头了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.30,1:10:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我活多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.21,1:11:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! By the way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.01,1:11:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想听听看你的神秘男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to hear about this mystery guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.98,1:11:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当剧烈的搅拌发生时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When extreme agitation occurs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.05,1:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,题目中的机能反应表现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}locomotive response in the subject shows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.65,1:11:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一种加速度… - 巴特勒博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- an acceleration... - Dr. Butler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.09,1:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能谈谈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have a word, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.86,1:11:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.30,1:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己在干什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.83,1:11:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想结束和你的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ending this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.70,1:11:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.31,1:11:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不应该和你开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never should've started seeing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.34,1:11:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was wrong,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.11,1:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.15,1:11:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 过去的已经过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I can't change what I've done,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.28,1:11:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但从今天开始 我想重新做人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can start trying to be a better person today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.22,1:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你励志书看多了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What lame little self-help book did you get that from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.66,1:11:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.16,1:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆那么爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a wife who loves you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.13,1:12:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你没办法对她忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you can't be faithful to her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.87,1:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,至少勇敢地离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at least have the balls to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.14,1:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,以后上我的课可别想水过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't expect me to let you coast by in my class now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.07,1:12:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,早就退班了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already dropped it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.28,1:12:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.95,1:12:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对于某些人在强制宿舍例会上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how totally sad and disappointing it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.39,1:12:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,缺席的情况 我感到非常失望和遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when certain people can't be bothered to make it to a mandatory house meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.26,1:12:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本该讨论今年的慈善活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were supposed to be picking this year's charity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.76,1:12:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,贝基？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Becky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.73,1:12:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是看到巧克力牛奶了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that chocolate milk I see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.07,1:12:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我没吃早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I skipped breakfast...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.37,1:12:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 太好吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! That is so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.81,1:12:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要开始聚餐了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up with the fat fest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.11,1:12:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是姐妹会辣妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're Kappas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.25,1:12:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 亲 及时行乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, hon, live a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.08,1:12:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,多吃点卡路里又不会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Few calories won't kill ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.28,1:12:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.05,1:12:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想像贝基那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll just turn me into a chunker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.05,1:12:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,满身都是肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Becky here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.76,1:13:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.75,1:13:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.75,1:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.95,1:13:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小翠？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.49,1:13:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.45,1:13:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我顺路过来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just, uh, coming by to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.20,1:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是演哪一出？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.47,1:13:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了 不过你今晚有事么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to run, but what are you doing later tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.04,1:13:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.74,1:13:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能带我出去过生日吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to take me out for my birthday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.21,1:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会在逗我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the punch line?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.84,1:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这很随便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know it's really random,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.34,1:13:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我保证明天和你解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I promise I'll explain everything tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.21,1:13:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有明天的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming there is one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.45,1:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快说可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.45,1:14:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.32,1:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.06,1:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,说定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.90,1:14:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.27,1:14:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这杯咖啡多少钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I pay for my coffee, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.11,1:14:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你不吃了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.11,1:14:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不吃了 请给我账单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, just the check, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.21,1:14:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等 就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.79,1:14:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 抱歉我来晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Daddy. Sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.83,1:14:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的领带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like your tie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.37,1:14:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.90,1:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,校园生活怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.97,1:14:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.44,1:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢你的课程吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like your classes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.14,1:14:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都挺好的 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fine, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.21,1:14:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想这样下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to do that anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.51,1:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不想怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.91,1:15:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,若即若离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.52,1:15:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.25,1:15:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这种日子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.12,1:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,今天这种日子对我来说很难熬过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this day is really... hard for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.83,1:15:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想念妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.33,1:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know? I miss her so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.10,1:15:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想念她的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss the way that she smells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.20,1:15:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想念她的大笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss that crazy horse laugh she has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.34,1:15:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.25,1:15:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I thought that if{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.62,1:15:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我逃避这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I avoided all of it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.19,1:15:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我逃避你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I avoided you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.45,1:15:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会容易些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that somehow it would be easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.62,1:15:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但事实不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.60,1:15:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只会变得更坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been so much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.50,1:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,逃避只会让人心更凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of this running and hiding has made me so miserable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.14,1:16:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我终于明白过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think I finally figured it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.94,1:16:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我经历了一些傻事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, it took something, like, totally crazy, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.31,1:16:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.98,1:16:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.59,1:16:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉让你伤心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am so, so sorry that I hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.63,1:16:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝女儿 生日快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.20,1:17:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.51,1:17:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,请慢慢站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.11,1:17:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.18,1:17:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.35,1:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.72,1:17:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,姑娘 你这么做可不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this-this is a really bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.59,1:17:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,死了16次也不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, so is dying for the 16th time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.23,1:17:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.43,1:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在转过身来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.00,1:17:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.73,1:17:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他要逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.74,1:17:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有话好好说 把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can talk about this. Just put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.40,1:17:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他要逃跑了 去找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to escape. Go get help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.21,1:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快去 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go! - Okay.{\r}
